able=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is said to\n<strong>flow</strong> under it.</p>","file":"ch24-applied/08-lax-pairs-and-the-toda-flow.html"}